          "how_to": "Read existing physical identities before creating nodes. Use batch-local @keys only for new dependencies. Above/below does not imply matching footprints. An open kitchen/dining connection is not an invented wall. Keep current observations separate from remodel proposals. Use notes_append for Building additions. Existing unscoped Buildings require explicit manual linking; Project membership does not grant physical-edit authority. A change is saved only with a successful receipt.",
