      "handler": "save_project_solution",
      "additional_description": "Read the current solution, selected target, linked images and prior decisions first. Preserve their exact scope and revisions. Record purpose, use, form/orientation and required features in design_intent. For each consequential choice record relevant alternatives, your supported recommendation, basis, consequences, chooser and actual selected direction; delegation is a mandate, not a chosen direction. Reuse prior owner decisions and explicit delegation. Resolve geometry-dependent technical questions through research and advice before construction, while an exploratory sketch may explicitly defer issues outside its purpose. Images supply intent, not measured dimensions. source_media_id names an accessible project reference. Explicit null source_media_id or design_intent clears that field; omitted fields on a legacy call preserve their previous values. Null design_intent remains unassessed and cannot establish readiness. A solution receipt records a proposal or design choice, not measured truth, target selection or structural approval.",
